      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reedsport%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The land where Reedsport now stands was originally home to the Lower Umpqua Native American tribe.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
